// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Fireball 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1663334668" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  This potent offensive magic repeatedly tries to "make friends" with those it encounters, causing more fire to come into being."
// DisplayNames :
"P3601915525" "Fireball"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Cloud_of_Ice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3578154659" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  Frigid temperatures permeate the air surrounding this living spell, slowing the movement of nearby aggressors."
// DisplayNames :
"P612590218" "Cloud of Ice"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Lightning_Storm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2177672377" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  This mass of electrical energy causes the air around it to visibly crackle, sending lightning flying to nearby grounding points at every possible juncture."
// DisplayNames :
"P741247010" "Lightning Storm"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Ball_of_Light 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3066428225" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  Balls of Light are made of pure optimism and hope, conjured together by an earnest effort to heal another being."
// DisplayNames :
"P4165888695" "Ball of Light"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Animated_Staff 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1214717337" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  This magic staff was once wielded by a powerful magic-user - their aptitude has bled into the weapon itself, granting it a life of its own."
// DisplayNames :
"P3776585995" "Animated Staff"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Forbidden_Knowledge 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2330456412" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  Infused with years of complex ritual magic, this ancient tome contains secrets never meant to be known."
// DisplayNames :
"P2106018732" "Forbidden Knowledge"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Crystal_Ball 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2413651698" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  Years of channelling power through the mists of time has granted these Crystal Balls the power to alter time's effects on objects in close proximity."
// DisplayNames :
"P394008952" "Crystal Ball"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Time_Stop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3260387100" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  This powerful spell was meant to stop all of time for its master, but quickly grew bored and wandered off on its own into the Night Ward."
// DisplayNames :
"P1303004440" "Time Stop"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Vorpal_Sword 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3619122295" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  Legendary artifacts only known in rumors and legends, Vorpal Swords are few and far between even in the Midnight Squad's prestigious membership, capable of dealing severe damage to any being wandering between dimensions."
// DisplayNames :
"P2740801945" "Vorpal Sword"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Gate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3821700904" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  Few wizards dare to call a Gate into existence, and even fewer correctly estimate their ability to control it.  The unfortunate soul of this Gate's summoner is forever bound to it, calling forth demons until this foul magic is dispelled."
// DisplayNames :
"P404305834" "Gate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Dispel_Magic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1403036508" "Dispel Magic"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Counter_Spell 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2339204938" "Counter Spell"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Ward 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2235123917" "The Animus Arcana are magical spells or items brought to life by the very nature of Night Ward's tenuous dimensional connections.  Ward is the sentient Overspell that is in charge of managing all of the magical defenses of the Midnight Mansion in Night Ward. He is the Spellfather of the Animus Arcana."
// DisplayNames :
"P1767765797" "Ward"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - AnimusArcana_Ward_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

