// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Scattered_Spirit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2729562939" "Though little is known about the origins of the Apparitions, it is well-documented that they appear to be beings of energy which seem to be powered by pure hatred. They seem almost human at times, as a form can sometimes be discerned in the swirl of energy that makes up their bodies, but no one is quite sure whether this is an illusion or not. The Scattered Spirit is among the weaker varieties, though unlike a Fractured Spirit, this type can merge with other entities."
// DisplayNames :
"P3450412444" "Scattered Spirit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Coalesced_Spirit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2661459247" "Though little is known about the origins of the Apparitions, it is well-documented that they appear to be beings of energy which seem to be powered by pure hatred. They seem almost human at times, as a form can sometimes be discerned in the swirl of energy that makes up their bodies, but no one is quite sure whether this is an illusion or not. A Coalesced Spirit is a more powerful spirit that arises when two Scattered Spirits have combined. The more powerful hatred they embody gives them some resistance to status effects, in addition to their other powers."
// DisplayNames :
"P2582493852" "Coalesced Spirit"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Fearsome_Reflection 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3964929513" "Though little is known about the origins of the Apparitions, it is well-documented that they appear to be beings of energy which seem to be powered by pure hatred. They seem almost human at times, as a form can sometimes be discerned in the swirl of energy that makes up their bodies, but no one is quite sure whether this is an illusion or not. This purple coalescence of energy is known as a Fearsome Reflection."
// DisplayNames :
"P2343197221" "Fearsome Reflection"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Dispersed_Impression 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3045815856" "Though little is known about the origins of the Apparitions, it is well-documented that they appear to be beings of energy which seem to be powered by pure hatred. They seem almost human at times, as a form can sometimes be discerned in the swirl of energy that makes up their bodies, but no one is quite sure whether this is an illusion or not. The Dispersed Impression is a stronger form than the Spirits. Unlike a Fractured Impression, this type can merge with other entities."
// DisplayNames :
"P3405878962" "Dispersed Impression"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Formed_Impression 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P489520396" "Though little is known about the origins of the Apparitions, it is well-documented that they appear to be beings of energy which seem to be powered by pure hatred. They seem almost human at times, as a form can sometimes be discerned in the swirl of energy that makes up their bodies, but no one is quite sure whether this is an illusion or not. A Formed Impression is a more powerful Apparition that arises when a Dispersed Impression combines with Scattered Spirits or other Formed Impressions. The more powerful hatred they embody gives them some resistance to status effects, in addition to their other powers."
// DisplayNames :
"P659764809" "Formed Impression"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Ripped_Spectre 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3058207802" "Though little is known about the origins of the Apparitions, it is well-documented that they appear to be beings of energy which seem to be powered by pure hatred. They seem almost human at times, as a form can sometimes be discerned in the swirl of energy that makes up their bodies, but no one is quite sure whether this is an illusion or not. The Ripped Spectre is a much stronger Apparition than other types, and is capable of merging into an even stronger form."
// DisplayNames :
"P2576357528" "Ripped Spectre"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Enraged_Spectre 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P870333076" "Though little is known about the origins of the Apparitions, it is well-documented that they appear to be beings of energy which seem to be powered by pure hatred. They seem almost human at times, as a form can sometimes be discerned in the swirl of energy that makes up their bodies, but no one is quite sure whether this is an illusion or not. An Enraged Spectre is among the most powerful of Apparitions. It is created when a Ripped Spectre combines with Scattered Spirits, Formed Impressions or other Enraged Spectres. The more powerful hatred they embody gives them some resistance to status effects, in addition to their other powers."
// DisplayNames :
"P2753108853" "Enraged Spectre"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Hive_of_Anger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1450249082" "Though little is known about the origins of the Apparitions, it is well-documented that they appear to be beings of energy which seem to be powered by pure hatred. They seem almost human at times, as a form can sometimes be discerned in the swirl of energy that makes up their bodies, but no one is quite sure whether this is an illusion or not. A Hive of Anger is a singularity of smaller apparitions, forming a mass of negative emotion so strong that it can draw lesser beings under its sway, increasing its own power."
// DisplayNames :
"P1306258074" "Hive of Anger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Enraged_Spectre_LT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Apparitions_Coalesced_Marker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2955792369" "Emergence"

