// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Guardian_Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1655972707" "Mu Guardians pulse with the blood of their slaughtered ancestors in their veins. They have read unholy tomes, visited other planes of existence, and performed dark sacrifices too terrible to mention to become masters of the mystic arts."
// DisplayNames :
"P483849233" "Mu Guardian"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Guardian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Guardian_High 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Guardian_Medium_High 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Striker_High_Ghost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3253254781" "Those of Mu ancestry who have delved too deeply into the secrets of their bloodline have a special fate awaiting them on death. For their goddess still waits for their souls in her strange spirit-city."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Adept_High_Ghost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4115378277" "Bound forever to the will of their ancient goddess, the souls of Mu Mystics travel to her spirit-city to serve as her guardians, and serve her in the eternal afterlife."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Guardian_High_Ghost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3120950756" "Could even a mystic as powerful as a Mu Guardian escape this fate? An eternal after-life in service to the Goddess Hequat? Perhaps. But none of them would want anything else than to serve their Goddess as their ancestors once did 14,000 years ago."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Striker_High_Ghost_Noexp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2314193619" "This strange shade appears to be the spirit of a Mu Mystic Striker who perished in Arachnos' constant battles. But how could he have appeared here?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Adept_High_Ghost_Noexp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2128277487" "This ghost was once an Adept of Arachnos' Mu Mystics. But what could bind his spirit to this strange service?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Mu_Guardian_High_Ghost_Noexp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2914512990" "The Mu Guardians are the most powerful of the Mu Mystics. What supernatural power could be strong enough to bind their spirits in this ghostly form?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Arachnobot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P22379172" "These attack drones are used to soften up super-powered targets. Arachnos considers them very expendable, and uses them to record and monitor a threat's abilities before more expensive troops-such as Tarantulas or Fortunatas-are deployed."
// DisplayNames :
"P3037095851" "Arachnobot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Arachnobot_Blaster 
