// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Regent_Korol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1123571344" "Regent Korol is one of the few Fortunatas chosen to devote themselves fully to Arachnos by becoming one of the powerful Tarantula Queens. Through the process she has gained immense psychic abilities that she uses to protect Arachnos from infiltration."
// DisplayNames :
"P3359754443" "Regent Korol"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_ShadowSpider 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P829416535" "Shadow Spider began her career as a Knife of Artemis, specializing in infiltration and intelligence jobs that no one thought possible. Now working with Arachnos, Shadow Spider acts friendly and nice, and is usually very good to her people, but can turn cold as ice and hard as steel when she needs to be."
// GroupDescription :
"P1902797650" "Arachnos"
// DisplayNames :
"P3933719368" "Shadow Spider"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Viridian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1017794982" "Viridian is a very dangerous man who works subtle deals that can change the course of world history. The core of his job is influencing other villain groups through manipulation, sabotage, deal brokering, or collaboration, as it suits the needs of Arachnos. There is some rivalry between his organization of manipulators and Shadow Spiders' spies, but both know that they can only succeed at their job with the help of the other."
// DisplayNames :
"P4186857967" "Agent Crimson"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_MuDrakhan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3543508689" "Magus Mu'Drakhan is a leading figure among the growing ranks of mystics working under the banner of Arachnos who trace their lineage to the ancient civilization known as Mu. Some whisper that he may be more loyal to his ancient bloodline than to Arachnos, but such whispers are often quietly silenced."
// DisplayNames :
"P2906415346" "Magus Mu Drakhan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Repairman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3690026716" "Cybernetic implants in their brains have given these Arachnos technicians an incredible affinity for technology. Under the guidance of Weaver-1, they work tirelessly to build and repair the machines of Arachnos."
// DisplayNames :
"P1467227972" "Arachnos Repairman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Healing_Generator_SSF 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P930335874" "These strange devices thrum with power, harvesting the meta-human energies gathered by the Web and channeling them into Lord Recluse."
// GroupDescription :
"P1214249427" "Generator"
// DisplayNames :
"P1460851249" "Power Transfer Tower"

