"P960074001" "This monstrous Giant Spider is rampaging through Siren's Call!"
// DisplayNames :
"P3955562035" "Jade Spider"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_FB_Giant_Spider_Exposed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2540556274" "It was a trick!  Defeat the Giant Spider before it destroys all of Paragon City!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Kalinda 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1155668716" "As an Arachnos Fortunata, it is Kalinda's task to keep an eye on all new arrivals to Mercy Island. That doesn't mean she's on their side. She is evaluating each new resident for signs of greatness, and for signs of weakness. Kalinda can set you on the path to greatness, or she can make sure you're never heard from again. There are only two things she believes in: the glory of Arachnos, and the survival of the fittest."
// DisplayNames :
"P2068388224" "Kalinda"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Arbiter_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2998678662" "The Arbiters are the living will of Lord Recluse. In the Rogue Isles, an attack on an Arbiter is an attack on Recluse himself. It is one of the few things that Recluse does not tolerate."
// DisplayClassName :
"P1767890595" "Arbiter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Aeon_Protector_Drone 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3471623196" "Dr. Aeon has built these drones specifically to power his new 'Aeon Invulnerability' device. You'll have to destroy them to weaken Dr. Aeon!"
// DisplayNames :
"P2679447858" "Aeon Protector Drone"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Operative_Kirkland 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P321338882" "Arachnos Operative Kirkland keeps tabs on the various villainous factions on Sharkhead Isle, making sure that no one group gains too much power or overly disrupts the day-to-day activities that keep the area functional."
// DisplayClassName :
"P239577006" "Arachnos Operative"
// DisplayNames :
"P2496012982" "Operative Kirkland"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Barracuda_EB_20_34 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Bane_Arbiter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Atlas_Pylon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1700029611" "A multi-purpose platform used by the Rikti.  These pylon casings can house a wide variety of equipment, ranging from construction gear, to force field generators. Arachnos has somehow obtained this technology and is using it for their own ends."
// DisplayClassName :
"P3785678515" "Pylon"
// DisplayNames :
"P261373018" "Arachnos Pylon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Arbiter_Low 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Dario_Stanzini 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2768098873" "Dario Stanzini was once a famous magician whose life was changed by a participant in his audience. He called the stranger up to be sawed in half. The man, not knowing it was staged, freaked out and placed a curse on Stanzini, dooming his family and loved ones to die within a year.<br><br>Three years have passed since then. Stanzini's loved one and family have all died off, leaving the man left with nothing but vengeance, hoping to one day find the man who did this and kill him. Stanzini has gone to great lengths to acquire the power to find this man, enough that he has been labelled as a villain in Paragon and has fled to the Isles to increase his power; he has gone so far as to even ally himself with Arachnos to get what he needs."
// DisplayNames :
"P2978894386" "Dario Stanzini"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Arachnos_Fire_Wire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4283346294" "Fire Wire is one of the many villains who inhabit Mercy Island. Fire Wire tends to boast and brag about most of his accomplishments, earning him the ire of any competing villains. However, he seems to have some semblance of bite behind his bark, or else he wouldn't still be alive today."
// DisplayNames :
"P1462234187" "Fire Wire"

