// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Husk_Rifle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3735526394" "The Banished Pantheon's powers reach from the spirit world to raise the bodies of long dead soldiers armed with the weapons of our forefathers. These dried out Husks of men provide the backbone of the Pantheon's armies - a never ending supply of undead warriors."
// DisplayNames :
"P3838424623" "Desiccated Husk"
// DisplayNames :
"P2349263357" "Dry Husk"
// DisplayNames :
"P681640827" "Rotting Husk"

