// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Chamber_Rifle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P501962429" "Their hatred for humanity and utter disdain for life have left the Banished Pantheon with few allies. Thus they must make their own, by raising the dead to create armies of zombie-like servants totally devoted to their devilish agenda."
// DisplayNames :
"P4087473468" "Desiccated Chamber"
// DisplayNames :
"P1263835824" "Dry Chamber"
// DisplayNames :
"P1120915467" "Rotting Chamber"

