// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Storm_WitchDoctor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3184617925" "The Storm Shamans have mastered the power of the tempest. Their summoned thunderstorms assail their foes with fiery bolts of lightning, while their windstorms make it difficult for their enemies to fight back."
// DisplayNames :
"P838913987" "Storm Shaman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Death_WitchDoctor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P51496144" "Death Shamans have done what few have dared. They have descended into the Underworld, and returned. After such an experience, these Shamans have power over life and death. They can drain the life from their victims or summon zombies to fight by their side."
// DisplayNames :
"P13342694" "Death Shaman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Avalanche_WitchDoctor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2985964042" "To become an Avalanche Shaman, one must climb the highest mountains in the world to commune with the Pantheon's dread gods. Once these labors are completed, Avalanche Shamans can command the Earth itself. Their favorite trick is to trap their foes in deadly prisons of stone. They delight in hearing the cries of their victims as the stones grind together mercilessly."
// DisplayNames :
"P3224969526" "Avalanche Shaman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Spirit_of_Sorrow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2925784656" "One of the four types of Corrupt Spirits, the Spirits of Sorrow thrive on sadness and depression. These spirits project blasts of pure sorrow that explode in life-sapping bursts, seeping the will and life force from anyone caught in the explosion."
// DisplayNames :
"P919872319" "Spirit of Sorrow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Spirit_of_Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3031242184" "One of the four types of Corrupt Spirits, the Spirits of Pain delight in agony and misery. They particularly delight in the pain that they dish out by projecting blasts of pure destruction at their enemies."
// DisplayNames :
"P2766423248" "Spirit of Pain"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Spirit_of_Desire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3062067505" "One of the four types of Corrupt Spirits, the Spirits of Desire feed upon greed, avarice, and the loss of control that comes with overwhelming need. They like to flood an area with telepathic imagery, confusing and even damaging opponents with visions of their greatest desires."
// DisplayNames :
"P3333242653" "Spirit of Desire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Spirit_of_Death 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1344006934" "One of the four types of Corrupt Spirits, the Spirits of Death take joy in anyone's demise, be they friend or foe. Once they've become focused on a victim, they become single-minded in their attacks and cannot be distracted. They will even destroy themselves if it means defeating their opponent of choice."
// DisplayNames :
"P3005234433" "Spirit of Death"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Totem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P271660045" "The Totems are avatars of the ancient gods of the Banished Pantheon. They are powerful, deadly foes who relish tearing heroes apart with their bare hands. They enjoy it so much that they ignore any attempts to disorient, dissuade, or divert their focus."
// DisplayNames :
"P277167048" "Totem"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Adamastor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3893456449" "For centuries, Adamastor caused havoc and destruction to sailors off the coast of Africa. According to legend, he attacked the sea goddess Thetis and was banished from the ocean forever. Miserable and bereft, Adamastor wandered the Dark Continent seeking mortal prey - until the Banished Pantheon found a use for him in Paragon City."
// DisplayNames :
"P816054277" "Adamastor"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Portal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2151841780" "The Banished Pantheon is attempting to contact the spirit world through this portal. It must be destroyed!"
// DisplayClassName :
// GroupDescription :
"P1483386653" "Mystical Construct"
// DisplayNames :
"P201496262" "Portal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Portal_Adamastor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayClassName :
"P3957587816" "Monster"

