// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Shaman_Storms_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P827764391" "The Storm Shaman has mastered the power of the tempest, calling upon lightning and thunder as their weapons of choice. They are particularly adept at exhausting their foes with continual shocks of lightning, though they are also capable of hindering the ability of a foe to attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Shaman_Storms_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P564847627" "The Storm Shamaness has mastered the power of the tempest, calling upon lightning and thunder as their weapons of choice. They are particularly adept at exhausting their foes with continual shocks of lightning, though they are also capable of hindering the ability of a foe to attack."
// DisplayNames :
"P2747808192" "Storm Shamaness"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Shaman_Death_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3738420793" "The Death Shaman has descended into the realm of death and returned. They walk between the worlds, granting some measure of power over life and death. They can drain the life from their victims, casting a pall of suffering across the battlefield."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Shaman_Death_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P980591546" "The Death Shamaness has descended into the realm of death and returned. They walk between the worlds, granting some measure of power over life and death. They can drain the life from their victims, casting a pall of suffering across the battlefield."
// DisplayNames :
"P3818549661" "Death Shamaness"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Shaman_Frost_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2017628913" "The Frost Shaman finds its origin in the frigid mountains at the roof of the world. There, the Shaman communes with the gods of the Pantheon to command the power of ice. They are quite adept at slowing the movement of their foes, making them less of a threat and easier to bring down."
// DisplayNames :
"P981573935" "Frost Shaman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Shaman_Frost_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1660020115" "Frost Shamaness"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Elder_of_Sorrow_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4258035306" "The Elders are priests and priestesses within the Banished Pantheon who have begun training to merge their essence with one of the many spirits who serve the gods. This Elder can call upon a Spirit of Sorrow as an ally, and projects blasts of pure sorrow that explode in life-sapping bursts, seeping the will and life force from anyone caught in the explosion."
// DisplayNames :
"P1861458153" "Elder of Sorrow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Elder_of_Sorrow_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P497751372" "Elder of Sorrow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Elder_of_Pain_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2600487225" "The Elders are priests and priestesses within the Banished Pantheon who have begun training to merge their essence with one of the many spirits who serve the gods. This Elder can call upon a Spirit of Pain as an ally and delights in agony and misery. They particularly relish the pain caused by the blasts of pure destruction they use to attack foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P2362518387" "Elder of Pain"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Elder_of_Pain_Female 
