"P221947954" "Elder of Pain"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheon_Elder_of_Desire_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P948263219" "The Elders are priests and priestesses within the Banished Pantheon who have begun training to merge their essence with one of the many spirits who serve the gods. This Elder can call upon a Spirit of Desire as an ally amd feeds upon the unrelenting pull of those who succumb to any form of overwhelming need. They flood the area around them with telepathic imagery, confusing and even damaging opponents with visions of their greatest desires."
// DisplayNames :
