// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4277884234" "The Elders are priests and priestesses within the Banished Pantheon who have begun training to merge their essence with one of the many spirits who serve the gods. This Elder can call upon a  Spirit of Death as an ally and delights in the death and decay of friend and foe alike. Once they focus on a victim, they become single-minded in their attacks and cannot be distracted until they have brought death to their opponent."
// DisplayNames :
