"P1297810617" "The Ancients are preists and priestesses within the Banished Pantheon who long ago merged their essence with one of the many spirits who serve the gods, granting both the person and the spirit a far greater share of power than they could ever achieve individually. This Ancient channels the Spirit of Sorrow and projects blasts of pure sorrow that explode in life-sapping bursts, seeping the will and life force from anyone caught in the explosion."
// DisplayNames :
