// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheonEndgame_Ravager 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3930542543" "The Ravager is a twisted creature whose origins are not fully understood. Its appearance is remarkably similar to that of the much larger and more powerful Sentinel, but it also shares many features with the lesser creatures spawned by a god of the Pantheon. It seems that a Ravager represents a point of transition within the service of a god, where one has acquired many gifts and blessings from its master, but is not yet strong enough to be seen as one of a god's primary lieutenants."
// DisplayNames :
"P4104072257" "Ravager"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheonEndgame_Sentinel_of_Mot_EliteBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3598096798" "The Sentinel of Mot is an extremely powerful creature dedicated to serving as guardian to the fallen god and executor of its master plan within Dark Astoria. Like all creatures to emerge from Mot as it breaks through the surface, it is a fearsome combatant, combining a terrifying presence and strength with an unexpected intelligence."
// DisplayNames :
"P1896885785" "The Sentinel of Mot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheonEndgame_Sentinel_of_Mot_EliteBoss_02 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - BanishedPantheonEndgame_Sentinel_of_Mot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1277064550" "After the defeat of Mot and the purging of Maximus from the Sentinel, the creature was left a soulless husk, perfect for Diabolique to claim for her own ends. Where once the Sentinel served Mot with strength and intelligence, this mindless creature is little more than a brutish monster whose only objective is to sow death and destruction while his new master completes her apotheosis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
