// Villain Def - CapauDiableDemons_Minion_Gremlin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4021231296" "These terrible little monsters somehow live inside the Cap au Diable Power Transferrance System. Perhaps there is more to the 'PTS' than meets the eye. There are certainly rumors. Many wonder why the PTS is covered in glowing sigils. Could that have something to do with these supernatural nuisances?"
// DisplayNames :
"P2639020373" "Gremlin"

