// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Acolyte 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2499995841" "The Luminous Acolytes serve as front line forces for the Carnival of Light. They can trace their origins back to the Legacy Chain, and retain some of their armor and accoutrements. Their mastery of the mystic arts is not as substantial as their superiors, but it far outstrips anything seen elsewhere in Praetoria."
// DisplayNames :
"P3945789970" "Luminous Acolyte"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Attendant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P98806049" "The Shining Attendants serve as front line forces for the Carnival of Light. They are drawn directly from the followers of Vanessa DeVore and are trained in the use of the magical staves that channel a great deal of power. Their mastery of the mystic arts is not as substantial as their superiors, but it far outstrips anything seen elsewhere in Praetoria."
// DisplayNames :
"P1092958730" "Shining Attendant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Eremite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1833367652" "The Radiant Eremites are well-trained in the mystical arts and serve as commanders in the Carnival of Light. They can trace their origins back to the Legacy Chain, and retain some of their armor and accoutrements. It is under their tutelage that novitiates can gain strength and help the organization at large."
// DisplayNames :
"P1747495811" "Radiant Eremite"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Anchorite_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2574610317" "The Mystic Anchorites are well-trained in the mystical arts and serve as commanders in the Carnival of Light. Many of them can trace their origins back to the Midnight Squad of Praetoria, but others have been derived from the followers of Vanessa DeVore. It is under their tutelage that novitiates can gain strength and help the organization at large."
// DisplayNames :
"P3722065994" "Mystic Anchorite"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Anchorite_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_AwakenedArmor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2948069825" "Brought to life by magical incantations retained by the former Midnight Squad and nearly lost to history, these animated golems serve as powerful guardians and sentries for the Carnival of Light. Constructed from scattered pieces of armor found around First Ward, the technologically advanced war machines make use of powerful tech swords which can fire bursts of energy at a target from range or rapidly cut them down in melee."
// DisplayNames :
"P4051522687" "Awakened Armor"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Mistress 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2736114802" "The Mistresses are extremely powerful sorceresses and mystics, able to twist magical energies into a diverse selection of abilities. They represent some of the most loyal of Vanessa's original followers and form the core leadership of all operations within the Praetorian Carnival. They bear the responsibility for integrating the remnants of the disparate magical groups in Praetoria into a cohesive unit. With few exceptions, they are the most talented mystics in the Carnival of Light."
// DisplayNames :
"P3301520585" "Resplendent Mistress"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_MagicalBarrier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1128385262" "This magical barrier has been set up by a member of the Carnival of Light."
// DisplayClassName :
"P787727156" "Barrier"
// DisplayNames :
"P824343949" "Magical Barrier"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Brilliance 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2112735323" "Brilliance"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Nadia 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3158287730" "Mistress Nadia, a powerful sorcerer of the Carnival of Light, watches over the Survivor Compound, striving to keep it safe from the myriad dangers of First Ward."
// DisplayNames :
"P1664050063" "Nadia"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Candlestick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1482332499" "Candlestick is a talented psychic of the Carnival of Light, given to brashness and ill-conceived plans."
// DisplayNames :
"P1203646604" "Candlestick"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfLight_Vanessa_DeVore_FirstWard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1712597565" "Vanessa DeVore is the mother of the resistance. It was her warning of what was to come in Cole's new world order that unified a small group of important military leaders into what would one day become the Resistance. Without DeVore's immense psychic power the Resistance would have been tracked down by Mother Mayhem's Seers, and smashed by the PPD."
// DisplayNames :

