// DisplayDescription :
"P56291645" "The Wrathful Acolytes serve as front line forces for the Carnival of Vengeance, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes it would be better to join the Talons of Vengeance, rather than resist them. They can trace their origins back to the Legacy Chain, and retain some of their armor and accoutrements."
// DisplayNames :
"P4060455271" "Wrathful Acolyte"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfVengeance_Attendant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2335177369" "The Vengeful Attendants serve as front line forces for the Carnival of Vengeance, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes it would be better to join the Talons of Vengeance, rather than resist them. They were once followers of Vanessa DeVore."
// DisplayNames :
"P1665456503" "Vengeful Attendant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfVengeance_Eremite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1983465436" "The Inimical Eremites are well-trained in the mystical arts and serve as commanders in the Carnival of Vengeance, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes it would be better to join the Talons of Vengeance, rather than resist them. They can trace their origins back to the Legacy Chain, and retain some of their armor and accoutrements."
// DisplayNames :
"P597951963" "Inimical Eremite"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfVengeance_Anchorite_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2681674611" "The Implacable Anchorites are well-trained in the mystical arts and serve as commanders in the Carnival of Vengeance, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes it would be better to join the Talons of Vengeance, rather than resist them. Many of them can trace their origins back to the Midnight Squad of Praetoria, but others have been derived from the followers of Vanessa DeVore."
// DisplayNames :
"P4036653597" "Implacable Anchorite"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
