// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfVengeance_Vermillion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4274891820" "Cerulean's blood lust has gotten the best of him and now he has let his thirst for vengeance completely overtake him. The blue wizard may yet exist somewhere behind those burning red eyes, but reasonable conversation with him seems an impossibility at this point. He's become an agent of vengeance."
// DisplayNames :
"P1220585127" "Vermillion"

