// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfWar_Acolyte 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4096657348" "The Acolytes of War serve as front line forces for the Carnival of War, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes that immediate action most be taken against the Talons of Vengeance no matter the cost, rather than building up Carnival forces for an overwhelming assault. They can trace their origins back to the Legacy Chain, and retain some of their armor and accoutrements."
// DisplayNames :
"P2858772225" "Acolyte of War"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfWar_Attendant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P732038437" "The Attendants of War serve as front line forces for the Carnival of War, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes that immediate action most be taken against the Talons of Vengeance no matter the cost, rather than building up Carnival forces for an overwhelming assault. They were once followers of Vanessa DeVore."
// DisplayNames :
"P2284055903" "Attendant of War"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfWar_Eremite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3312328475" "The Eremites of War are well-trained in the mystical arts and serve as commanders in the Carnival of War, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes that immediate action most be taken against the Talons of Vengeance no matter the cost, rather than building up Carnival forces for an overwhelming assault. They can trace their origins back to the Legacy Chain, and retain some of their armor and accoutrements."
// DisplayNames :
"P3595510028" "Eremite of War"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfWar_Anchorite_Male 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2959077018" "The Anchorites of War are well-trained in the mystical arts and serve as commanders in the Carnival of War, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes that immediate action most be taken against the Talons of Vengeance no matter the cost, rather than building up Carnival forces for an overwhelming assault. Many of them can trace their origins back to the Midnight Squad of Praetoria, but others have been derived from the followers of Vanessa DeVore."
// DisplayNames :
"P2832401053" "Anchorite of War"

