// Villain Def - CarnivalOfWar_AwakenedArmor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2708349988" "Brought to life by magical incantations retained by the former Midnight Squad and nearly lost to history, these animated golems serve as powerful guardians and sentries for the Carnival of War, a faction of the Carnival of Light which believes that immediate action most be taken against the Talons of Vengeance no matter the cost, rather than building up Carnival forces for an overwhelming assault. Constructed from scattered pieces of armor found around First Ward, the technologically advanced war machines make use of powerful tech swords which can fire bursts of energy at a target from range or rapidly cut them down in melee."
// DisplayNames :
"P346708633" "Armor of War"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - CarnivalOfWar_Mistress 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2420896725" "The Mistresses are extremely powerful sorceresses and mystics, able to twist magical energies into a diverse selection of abilities. With few exceptions, they are the most talented mystics in the Carnival of War, and form the core of its leadership. They represent some of the most loyal of Vanessa's original followers, and they would return to the fold if only she would see things as they do."
// DisplayNames :
"P3002025560" "Mistress of War"

