// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Thug 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P290053632" "A Cor Leonis is a Council soldier who has undergone a long and painful regimen of super soldier treatments. The Nebula Cor Leonis are the most numerous of these medical marvels, but that doesn't mean they're common. They've had extensive training and thousands of dollars worth of drugs pumped into them. It's an investment that usually pays off, since a first rank Cor Leonis is stronger than five normal men."
// DisplayNames :
"P3530032641" "Nebula Cor Leonis Marksman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P429874528" "Nebula Cor Leonis Fire"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3250660678" "Nebula Cor Leonis Assault"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3873572121" "The pinnacle of frontline soldiers, the Cor Leonis Adjutants are nearly unstoppable fighting machines. It often takes an anti-tank weapon just to faze one of these juggernauts. Fortunately, their numbers are small, though the Council keeps making more of them as their soldiers become more experienced."
// DisplayNames :
"P161329556" "Nebula Cor Leonis Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Nebula_Cor_Leonis_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2863355557" "The highest ranking soldiers among the Nebula, the Nebula Cor Leonis Archons are strikingly capable field officers, able to formulate and execute grand military campaigns. Unlike most modern officers, these Cor Leonis are not afraid to personally lead their soldiers into battle. After all, their own abilities far surpass those of all normal men and many super-powered heroes."
// DisplayNames :
"P2480489275" "Nebula Cor Leonis Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3123804481" "The Penumbra is the Council's special operations division, tasked with covert ops, assassinations, and espionage. Even the lowest level recruits receive some special training, particularly in stealth and evasion techniques. New recruits must have some military or law enforcement experience before being accepted into the Penumbra."
// DisplayNames :
"P1181607808" "Penumbra Gunner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Missle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2841953632" "Penumbra Buckshot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Flamethrower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2245610004" "Penumbra Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Chaingun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3580476802" "Penumbra Assault"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Martial_Arts 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1316333616" "Penumbra Marksman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3654489165" "The Penumbra Adjutants have completed their covert ops training and are on the verge of being promoted to Elite status. They have yet to benefit from a course of super soldier serum, but they have honed their stealth and physique to a near perfect level. Adjutants are often tasked with leading squads of Penumbra soldiers on raids to raise funds for the Council."
// DisplayNames :
"P2508201893" "Penumbra Adjutant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P247081773" "A Penumbra Archon is responsible for overseeing squads of covert operatives. Since coverts ops need to be precise and perfectly executed, a Penumbra Archon is valued chiefly for his ability to follow orders precisely and make sure his troops do the same. In return for loyalty and good service, Archons receive their first taste of super soldier serum, making them stronger and quicker than any normal human could be."
// DisplayNames :
"P975030311" "Penumbra Archon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_SMG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Penumbra_Soldier_Shotgun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

