// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3447947384" "The Galaxy Band of the Council has been trained by Arakhn in stealth and infiltration. They have also been conditioned by Kheldian mind control techniques to be loyal to her above all others."
// DisplayNames :
"P4044822080" "Galaxy"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Council_Galaxy_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
