// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Crey_Grenade_Armored_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P7337719" "Crey sends these specialized units to handle big problems.  Their grenade launchers can fire a variety of munitions, making them well-equipped to handle any situation.  These armor clad leaders carry enough firepower to stop a tank. They're also almost as hard to hurt, though they are vulnerable to mental assaults."
// DisplayNames :
